##
## Upstream tests to disable on Windows
##
## When adding a new filter to this list, please include a short description of
## why the filter is required and create an associated tracking issue.
##

# Same as updater_tests-win.filter: both binaries contain these suites.
-GoogleTestVerification.UninstantiatedParameterizedTestSuite<IntegrationLowerVersionTest>
-GoogleTestVerification.UninstantiatedParameterizedTestSuite<IntegrationSansInstallIdTest>
